{"id":400401302,"chapter_id":50016,"scene_id":51621,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"悪戦苦闘の後、リンの体力は底をついてしまった。だがガオ大魔王の声はまだ遠くから聞こえてくる。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"村人","content":"リン？あなたなの？リン！","voice":["vo_event_400401302_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04013","style":1,"background":4041,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"村人","content":"俺たちに構うな！飴を探すんだ……今のお前ではあいつに勝てない。頼んだぞ！","voice":["vo_event_400401302_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04013","style":1,"background":4041,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"村人たちの弱まっていく声が洞窟から聞こえてきた。","style":3,"background":4041,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"リン","content":"……","style":1,"background":4041,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"リン","content":"うぅ……みんな……ごめんなさい……","voice":["vo_event_400401302_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_04013","style":1,"background":4042,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"そうして、リンは洞窟に入るのを諦めて、勇気のアメを探し続けた。","style":3,"background":4042,"log_type":1}]}